# ============================================
# Nabung Nikah - Environment Variables
# ============================================
# Copy file ini ke .env dan isi dengan credentials Anda
# JANGAN commit file .env ke Git!

# Supabase Configuration
# Dapatkan dari: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/YOUR_PROJECT/settings/api
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Contoh format yang benar:
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://abcdefg.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# ============================================
# PENGATURAN VERCEL (WAJIB agar deploy di Vercel berfungsi):
# ============================================
# 1. Buka https://vercel.com/dashboard → pilih project "nabung-nikah"
# 2. Settings → Environment Variables, tambahkan:
#      VITE_SUPABASE_URL        = Project URL Supabase Anda
#      VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   = anon public key Supabase Anda
#    (Environment: Production, Preview, dan Development)
# 3. Setelah menambah env, lakukan Redeploy agar nilai env ter-bake
#    ke bundle saat build.
# Catatan: konfigurasi build ada di vercel.json (framework: vite,
# outputDirectory: dist, rewrite SPA, fungsi /api/health).

# ============================================
# CARA MENDAPATKAN CREDENTIALS:
# ============================================
# 1. Buka https://supabase.com/dashboard/
# 2. Pilih project Anda
# 3. Klik Settings (icon gear) di sidebar kiri
# 4. Klik API
# 5. Copy "Project URL" → paste ke VITE_SUPABASE_URL
# 6. Copy "anon public" key → paste ke VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# 
# PENTING:
# - Gunakan anon public key (BUKAN service_role key)
# - Service_role key hanya untuk backend, jangan di-expose ke frontend
# ============================================
